 8\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n\u003c/section>", "\u003csection class=\"k\" id=\"audit-07\" data-card=\"audit-07\">\n  \u003cdiv class=\"ktop\">\u003cspan class=\"wm\">THEMARIC\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"sig\">Data · Price · Deal\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"khr\">\u003c/div>\n  \u003cspan class=\"chip\">기록\u003c/span>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"kbody\">\n      \u003ch2 class=\"h2\">표시만 컸던 것\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"m\">53일 + 세일 7일, 가격 변동 없음\u003c/span>\u003c/h2>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"rows\">\u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cdiv class=\"rl\">\u003cdiv class=\"rb\">얼터너티브스테레오\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rt\">슈가 크런치 블러셔 (망곰 콜라보)\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rr\">\u003cdiv class=\"rp\">표시 \u003cb class=\"c\">70%\u003c/b> 할인\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rs\">정가 23,000원 · 53일 내내 6,900원\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cdiv class=\"rl\">\u003cdiv class=\"rb\">제이준\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rt\">콜라겐 스킨 핏 탄력 강화 마스크팩 10매\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rr\">\u003cdiv class=\"rp\">표시 \u003cb class=\"c\">67%\u003c/b> 할인\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rs\">정가 39,000원 · 53일 내내 12,900원\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cdiv class=\"rl\">\u003cdiv class=\"rb\">키스미\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rt\">히로인메이크 마이크로 마스카라 EX\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rr\">\u003cdiv class=\"rp\">표시 \u003cb class=\"c\">64%\u003c/b> 할인\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rs\">정가 22,000원 · 53일 내내 7,900원\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cdiv class=\"rl\">\u003cdiv class=\"rb\">싸이닉\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rt\">엔조이 슈퍼 마일드 선 에센스 50ml\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rr\">\u003cdiv class=\"rp\">표시 \u003cb class=\"c\">63%\u003c/b> 할인\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rs\">정가 15,000원 · 53일 내내 5,520원\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cdiv class=\"rl\">\u003cdiv class=\"rb\">사이오스\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rt\">올레오 염색약 (3종 동일)\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"rr\">\u003cdiv